<title>JAPAN: Harima Chemicals - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Harima Chemicals - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.20		vs	   11.43</p>
<p> Operating	  843 million	 vs	  550 million</p>
<p> Current	    926 million	 vs	  620 million</p>
<p> Net		  252 million	 vs	  178 million</p>
